      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAVALRY MAN (6) was outclassed in the Ipswich Cup two back then didn't respond well to his new role as leader last start here and capitulated at the end of this trip. Beautifully in with the claim and if ridden a little quieter can finish over the top of these. BARAZIN (8) went through his gears impressively to upset FIRM AGREEMENT in a Class 6 over 2200m at Grafton last time out. Honest campaigner who can hold the good form. GALANO (4) came from worse than midfield to get up for third recently over the mile at this track. On trial at this distance but he is finding the line as though it will suit. FERNAO (7) has not raced since a respectable effort in the Listed 2400m Queen Elizabeth Cup at Randwick seven weeks ago. Cannot be ruled out down in the weights. YET HE MOVES (1) has been in the money at four of five runs here at this distance, including a couple of wins. Better effort last start so don't leave him out of calculations.",
